  m_text: "A slow, squishy blob that just keeps moving forward. It has no tricks,
    no special abilities, and very little brain \u2014 it\u2019s dangerous only when
    there are a lot of them. Defeat enough of these and you\u2019ll be ready for
    the real threats."
